OL,3,GNEWSAFamily tribute to 'loving soul'
OL,4,Akilled in Borders crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a man who was killed in
OL,7,Fthree-vehicle crash in the Borders have
OL,8,Fdescribed him as a "gentle, kind,
OL,9,Floving soul".
OL,11,FPeter Brown, 43, who was known as
OL,12,FRichard, died at the scene of the
OL,13,Faccident on the A6089, near the village
OL,14,Fof Gordon.
OL,16,FHe was driving a Ford Focus when it was
OL,17,Finvolved in a collision, with a Toyota
OL,18,FHilux and a Tesla Model S, at about
OL,19,F17:55 on 27 October.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
