OL,3,GNEWSAFamily tribute to 'loving soul'
OL,4,Akilled in Borders crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, his family said he
OL,7,Fwould be "deeply missed by his
OL,8,Fheartbroken parents, wider family and
OL,9,Fmany friends".
